{"seq":1,"slug":"h264-h265","title":"H.264/H.265 编码架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/h264-h265","wordCount":1123,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"h-264-h-265-编码架构\">H.264/H.265 编码架构</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>H.264（AVC）和 H.265（HEVC）是当今视频生态的两大支柱编解码器——它们覆盖了从手机录制到蓝光光盘、从视频监控到 4K 流媒体的几乎所有场景。H.264 于 2003 年发布，至今仍是兼容性最广的编码格式；H.265 于 2013 年发布，在同等质量下码率减半，是 4K/HDR 时代的主力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Video Codec Evolution&lt;br/&gt;视频编码进化&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;H.264/AVC (2003)&lt;br/&gt;高清时代标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;H.265/HEVC (2013)&lt;br/&gt;4K时代标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;H.266/VVC (2020)&lt;br/&gt;下一代(推广中)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Macroblock 16x16&lt;br/&gt;宏块&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;CTU up to 64x64&lt;br/&gt;编码树单元&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;CTU up to 128x128&lt;br/&gt;更大块&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Video Codec Evolution&lt;br/&gt;视频编码进化\"] --&gt; B[\"H.264/AVC (2003)&lt;br/&gt;高清时代标准\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"H.265/HEVC (2013)&lt;br/&gt;4K时代标准\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"H.266/VVC (2020)&lt;br/&gt;下一代(推广中)\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Macroblock 16x16&lt;br/&gt;宏块\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"CTU up to 64x64&lt;br/&gt;编码树单元\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"CTU up to 128x128&lt;br/&gt;更大块\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>混合编码框架（Hybrid Coding）</strong>：预测 → 变换 → 量化 → 熵编码的流水线，H.264/H.265 共享同一范式。</li>\n<li><strong>帧内与帧间预测</strong>：帧内利用空间冗余、帧间利用时间冗余，两者在 RDO 框架下自动择优。</li>\n<li><strong>块结构</strong>：H.264 使用固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\times16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 宏块，H.265 改为四叉树分割的 CTU（最大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\times64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span>），平坦区域效率大幅提升。</li>\n<li><strong>量化参数（QP）</strong>：唯一的有损环节，QP 越大压缩率越高、质量越低。</li>\n<li><strong>GOP（图片组）</strong>：以 I 帧为随机访问锚点、P/B 帧提供压缩，长度在压缩率与 seek 速度间权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"混合编码框架\">混合编码框架</h2><h3 id=\"基本架构\">基本架构</h3><p>H.264 和 H.265 共享&quot;混合编码&quot;（Hybrid Coding）框架——预测 + 变换 + 量化 + 熵编码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Encoded</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Entropy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Quantize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Transform</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Residual</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Encoded} = \\text{Entropy}(\\text{Quantize}(\\text{Transform}(\\text{Residual})))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Encoded</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Entropy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quantize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Transform</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Residual</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>H.264</th>\n<th>H.265</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预测</td>\n<td>利用已知数据预测当前块</td>\n<td>帧内16模式 + 帧间</td>\n<td>帧内35模式 + 帧间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换</td>\n<td>去相关性，能量集中</td>\n<td>4×4/8×8 DCT</td>\n<td>4×4~32×32 DCT/DST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化</td>\n<td>有损压缩（丢弃高频）</td>\n<td>QP 0-51</td>\n<td>QP 0-51</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熵编码</td>\n<td>无损压缩最终码流</td>\n<td>CAVLC/CABAC</td>\n<td>CABAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环路滤波</td>\n<td>消除块效应</td>\n<td>去块滤波</td>\n<td>去块+SAO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"帧类型系统\">帧类型系统</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    I[&quot;I Frame&lt;br/&gt;关键帧&quot;] --&gt; P1[&quot;P Frame&lt;br/&gt;前向预测&quot;]&#10;    P1 --&gt; B1[&quot;B Frame&lt;br/&gt;双向预测&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;B Frame&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; P2[&quot;P Frame&quot;]&#10;    P2 --&gt; I2[&quot;I Frame&lt;br/&gt;下一个GOP&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    I[\"I Frame&lt;br/&gt;关键帧\"] --&gt; P1[\"P Frame&lt;br/&gt;前向预测\"]\n    P1 --&gt; B1[\"B Frame&lt;br/&gt;双向预测\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[\"B Frame\"]\n    B2 --&gt; P2[\"P Frame\"]\n    P2 --&gt; I2[\"I Frame&lt;br/&gt;下一个GOP\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧类型</th>\n<th>参考方向</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I 帧（关键帧）</td>\n<td>无参考（自包含）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5–10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5–10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> P帧）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P 帧（前向预测）</td>\n<td>参考前方帧</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 帧（双向预测）</td>\n<td>参考前后帧</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"h-264-核心特性\">H.264 核心特性</h2><h3 id=\"宏块-macroblock-结构\">宏块（Macroblock）结构</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Frame</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Slice</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Macroblock (16×16)</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Sub-block (4×4/8×8)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Frame} \\rightarrow \\text{Slice} \\rightarrow \\text{Macroblock (16×16)} \\rightarrow \\text{Sub-block (4×4/8×8)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Frame</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Slice</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Macroblock (16×16)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sub-block (4×4/8×8)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>规格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本块大小</td>\n<td>16×16 像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧内预测模式</td>\n<td>4×4: 9模式, 16×16: 4模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧间预测</td>\n<td>1/4 像素精度运动估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考帧数</td>\n<td>最多 16 帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Profile 等级</td>\n<td>Baseline/Main/High/High 10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"h-264-profile-对比\">H.264 Profile 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Profile</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Baseline</td>\n<td>无B帧、无CABAC</td>\n<td>视频通话、低延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Main</td>\n<td>B帧+CABAC</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>8×8变换、自适应量化</td>\n<td>蓝光/高质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High 10</td>\n<td>10-bit</td>\n<td>HDR 内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High 4:2:2</td>\n<td>4:2:2 子采样</td>\n<td>专业制作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"h-265-核心改进\">H.265 核心改进</h2><h3 id=\"ctu-编码树单元\">CTU（编码树单元）</h3><p>H.265 最大的结构性改进——将固定 16×16 宏块替换为灵活的四叉树分割：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CTU</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>四叉树</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>32</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTU}: 64\\times64 \\xrightarrow{\\text{四叉树}} 32\\times32 \\rightarrow 16\\times16 \\rightarrow 8\\times8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">四叉树</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>改进</th>\n<th>H.264</th>\n<th>H.265</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大块</td>\n<td>16×16</td>\n<td>64×64</td>\n<td>平坦区域效率大增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小块</td>\n<td>4×4</td>\n<td>4×4</td>\n<td>细节保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测模式</td>\n<td>9+4</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>更精确预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动补偿精度</td>\n<td>1/4 pel</td>\n<td>1/4 pel + 合并模式</td>\n<td>更好运动估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环路滤波</td>\n<td>去块</td>\n<td>去块+SAO</td>\n<td>更少伪影</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"压缩效率对比\">压缩效率对比</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>H.265 码率</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>H.264 码率</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>相同 PSNR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H.265 码率} \\approx 0.5 \\times \\text{H.264 码率} \\quad (\\text{相同 PSNR})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H.265 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">码率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H.264 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">码率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相同</span><span class=\"mord\"> PSNR</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>H.265 vs H.264 码率节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4K 视频</td>\n<td>40-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1080p 视频</td>\n<td>35-45%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高运动场景</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态场景</td>\n<td>50-60%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编码参数与质量控制\">编码参数与质量控制</h2><h3 id=\"码率控制模式\">码率控制模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>恒定比特率</td>\n<td>CBR</td>\n<td>码率严格恒定</td>\n<td>直播/广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变比特率</td>\n<td>VBR</td>\n<td>复杂场景多分配</td>\n<td>文件分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恒定质量</td>\n<td>CRF/CQP</td>\n<td>视觉质量恒定</td>\n<td>离线编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两遍编码</td>\n<td>2-pass</td>\n<td>全局最优分配</td>\n<td>最终成品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"crf-质量指南\">CRF 质量指南</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CRF</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>无损</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>最差</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CRF}: 0 = \\text{无损}, 51 = \\text{最差}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CRF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无损</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">51</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最差</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CRF 值</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>码率（1080p/24fps 约）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>视觉无损</td>\n<td>档案/母版</td>\n<td>15-25 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21-23</td>\n<td>高质量</td>\n<td>分发/蓝光级</td>\n<td>5-12 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25-28</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>网络/流媒体</td>\n<td>2-5 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30+</td>\n<td>低质量</td>\n<td>预览/草稿</td>\n<td>&lt; 2 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>H.264 和 H.265 代表了视频编码从高清到超高清的进化——核心思想相同（预测+变换+量化），但 H.265 通过更灵活的块结构和更多的预测模式实现了约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 的码率节省。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>H.264</th>\n<th>H.265</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布年</td>\n<td>2003</td>\n<td>2013</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩效率</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性</td>\n<td>极广</td>\n<td>广</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3–5\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3–5</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解码复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5–2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5–2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专利费</td>\n<td>成熟/低</td>\n<td>复杂/较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳场景</td>\n<td>兼容优先</td>\n<td>质量/效率优先</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"H.264/H.265 编码架构","id":"h-264-h-265-编码架构"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"混合编码框架","id":"混合编码框架"},{"level":3,"text":"基本架构","id":"基本架构"},{"level":3,"text":"帧类型系统","id":"帧类型系统"},{"level":2,"text":"H.264 核心特性","id":"h-264-核心特性"},{"level":3,"text":"宏块（Macroblock）结构","id":"宏块-macroblock-结构"},{"level":3,"text":"H.264 Profile 对比","id":"h-264-profile-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"H.265 核心改进","id":"h-265-核心改进"},{"level":3,"text":"CTU（编码树单元）","id":"ctu-编码树单元"},{"level":3,"text":"压缩效率对比","id":"压缩效率对比"},{"level":2,"text":"编码参数与质量控制","id":"编码参数与质量控制"},{"level":3,"text":"码率控制模式","id":"码率控制模式"},{"level":3,"text":"CRF 质量指南","id":"crf-质量指南"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"扫描方式与场序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/scan-methods"},"next":{"title":"AV1 编码与开放标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/av1"}}